NNAAMMEE
       mdatopbm - convert a Microdesign .mda or .mdp file into a PBM image


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       mmddaattooppbbmm [--dd] [--ii] [----] [_m_d_a_f_i_l_e]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       mmddaattooppbbmm  reads a MicroDesign file as input and Produces a PBM image as
       output.

       If you don't specify _m_d_a_f_i_l_e, mmddaattooppbbmm takes its  input  from  Standard
       Input.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In  addition  to  the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), mmddaattooppbbmm  recognizes  the
       following command line options:




       --dd     Double  the height of the output file, to compensate for the as‐
              pect ratio used in MicroDesign files.


       --ii     Invert the colors used.


       ----     End of options (use this if the filename starts with "-")



       The program also accepts option --aa for historical reasons, for
         the same meaning as the Netpbm common option --ppllaaiinn.



